<img src="https://images.macrumors.com/article-new/2026/10/App-Store-Indie-Games-Week.jpg" alt="" width="160" height="90" class="brief size-full wp-image-1070155" align="left" style="float:left;margin:0 20px 20px 0;width:160px;height:auto;" />Apple today <a href="https://www.apple.com/newsroom/2026/10/app-store-indie-games-week-kicks-off-today/">announced</a> it is <a href="https://apps.apple.com/us/story/id6793311746">Indie Games Week</a> on the App Store, in celebration of the "incredible catalog of imaginative games made by independent teams with big dreams."<br/>
<br/>
